1
00:00:00,445 --> 00:00:01,945
Why do they say "AA"?

2
00:00:02,531 --> 00:00:03,661
(Leonard:)Army Ants.

3
00:00:04,991 --> 00:00:08,831
(Leonard:)Isn't that confusing? AA might mean
something else to certain people.

4
00:00:09,788 --> 00:00:13,578
(Sheldon:)Why would a Physics Bowl team
be called Anodized Aluminum?

5
00:00:13,917 --> 00:00:14,957
(Leonard:)No, I meant...

6
00:00:16,294 --> 00:00:17,924
(Leonard:)Never mind.

7
00:00:18,088 --> 00:00:19,798
(Leonard:)Hey, check it out.

8
00:00:19,965 --> 00:00:23,095
(Leonard:)I got you a Batman cookie jar.

9
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:26,350
(Sheldon:)Oh, neat. What's the occasion?

10
00:00:26,513 --> 00:00:29,643
(Leonard:)Well, you're a friend
and you like Batman and cookies...

11
00:00:29,808 --> 00:00:31,308
(Leonard:)...and you're off the team.

12
00:00:34,813 --> 00:00:36,023
SHELDON:
What?

13
00:00:36,189 --> 00:00:38,529
(Leonard:)Howard, Raj and I
just had a team meeting.

14
00:00:38,692 --> 00:00:40,862
(Sheldon:)- You didn't.
- We did. I just came from there.

15
00:00:41,027 --> 00:00:44,527
(Sheldon:)I don't know where you just came from.
It couldn't have been a team meeting.

16
00:00:44,698 --> 00:00:48,618
(Sheldon:)I'm on the team and I wasn't there.
Ergo, the team did not meet.

17
00:00:49,202 --> 00:00:51,912
(Leonard:)Okay, let me try it this way.

18
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:54,830
(Leonard:)I was at a coffee klatch
with a couple of friends...

19
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,710
(Leonard:)...and one thing led to another
and, it turns out, you're off the team.

20
00:00:59,713 --> 00:01:03,023
(Howard:)- Why?
- Because you're taking all the fun out of it.

